  values ('ME', 'short_answer', 'A patient-satisfaction survey by the Hospital Administration and Management Transformation (HAMT) programme showed that most patients were not satisfied with: the behaviour of staff; the communication skills of staff; OPD waiting time; and the emergency response of staff. Explain some ways in which you would help the HAMT programme and the management to improve patient satisfaction. (3 marks)', 'Behaviour and communication of staff: run regular training in customer care, empathy and communication; greet patients, introduce ourselves, explain procedures and medicines in simple language (Dzongkha/local language), respect privacy and dignity; display name badges; supervise and recognise staff who serve patients well.
OPD waiting time: introduce a token/queue and appointment system, triage patients so urgent cases are seen first, open more counters and assign more staff at peak hours, start OPD on time, use electronic records, and provide a help desk and clear signboards so patients do not get lost.
Emergency response: keep a trained team on duty 24 hours, use triage and written protocols, hold regular drills, keep equipment, drugs and ambulances ready, and coordinate with the 112 ambulance service.
Monitoring: set up suggestion/grievance boxes and a feedback hotline, repeat patient-satisfaction surveys and act on the results.', null, '[{"point": "Staff behaviour and communication: training in customer care/soft skills and empathy, greeting and explaining in a language patients understand, respecting privacy, name badges, supervision and recognition of good behaviour", "marks": 1}, {"point": "Waiting time: token/queue and appointment system, triage, more counters at peak hours, clear signage/help desk, starting OPD on time, electronic records", "marks": 1}, {"point": "Emergency response: staffed 24-hour emergency team, protocols and drills, ready equipment and ambulance coordination; plus feedback/grievance box and regular surveys to monitor", "marks": 1}]'::jsonb, (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'general-subject-knowledge'),
